# Admin SSH authorized keys
#
# One SSH public key per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# These keys are deployed to all hosts via base.nix (openssh.authorizedKeys.keys).
#
# Supports multiple keys — add one key per line:
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAA... alice@workstation
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAA... bob@laptop
#
# After editing, commit and push. Comin will apply the change on all hosts
# automatically (no redeployment needed).
#
# See docs/secrets.md § "ADMIN_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY" for bootstrap instructions.
